    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199-a1">

                <pb facs="0617" n="403" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg403"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Northern German Legation</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">D. C.:</hi></p>
                <p>The treatment of German merchant ships by France obliges us to revoke the
                    declaration made by us at the beginning of the war, “exempting all French
                    merchant vessels, not carrying contraband of war articles, from capture by our
                    war-vessels.”</p>
                <p>As neutral property may have been shipped on board of French vessels in
                    confidence of the above declaration, the new measure will not be carrried into
                    effect until four weeks after this date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BISMARCK.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Versailles</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 13.</date></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
